        <title>Upcoming Show in February</title>
        <link>http://localhost:1313/thesneers/p/upcoming-show-in-february/</link>
        <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <author>info@thesneers.com (The Sneers)</author>
        <guid>http://localhost:1313/thesneers/p/upcoming-show-in-february/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="http://localhost:1313/thesneers/p/upcoming-show-in-february/7949.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Upcoming Show in February" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Sneers will be invading the Empire State’s Salt City on Feb. 21 for a show at Funk-n-Waffles with Niagara Falls punk legends Virus X of and first-wave Buffalo hardcore band, GOA. Joining them on the bill will be Rome NY’s No Complyance! Doors at 7 pm. $10 cover.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
